{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WASD: The Adventure of Tori \u2013 Online Co-op Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD : The Adventure of Tori\u00a0</strong>is an online co-op game for <strong>2\u20134 players</strong>, where each player can only use their automatically assigned key (W, A, S, or D).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;A game that destroys friendships with friends!&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;How many attempts will it take to clear the stage?&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/9fcb57750c1002905a51ebdf45dcab21.poster.avif?t=1771561131\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/9fcb57750c1002905a51ebdf45dcab21.webm?t=1771561131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/9fcb57750c1002905a51ebdf45dcab21.mp4?t=1771561131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You can\u2019t clear alone, you must move together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the character starts moving, <strong>it cannot stop</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only change direction using your assigned key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touching obstacles isn\u2019t the only danger-hitting a wall means instant death.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You\u2019ll learn the rest by crashing into it\u2026 a lot.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Focus &amp; Communicate!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/b4778a96ad6cf63f874755ba47afec49.poster.avif?t=1771561131\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/b4778a96ad6cf63f874755ba47afec49.webm?t=1771561131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/b4778a96ad6cf63f874755ba47afec49.mp4?t=1771561131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From blocks and traps to time limits, each stage is different.   <br>You\u2019ll need perfect timing, teamwork, and good communication.<br>Without it, you\u2019ll never (ever!) make it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In-game voice chat is supported by default, but we recommend using <strong>Discord</strong> or <strong>Zoom</strong> for smoother communication.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friendship Destroyer? Or Teamwork Builder?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/ea2c289f983f1486771a24aa2d711989.poster.avif?t=1771561131\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/ea2c289f983f1486771a24aa2d711989.webm?t=1771561131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/ea2c289f983f1486771a24aa2d711989.mp4?t=1771561131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh, shout, blame your friends\u2026 and try again!  Play with family, friends, or anyone nearby. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Want to get closer to your friends?\u00a0</strong></i>Play <strong>WASD: The Adventure of Tori</strong> together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Probably...?</strong></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect for Killing Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/ae8b8fecd2eb488316ae6b4cc2422b1b.poster.avif?t=1771561131\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/ae8b8fecd2eb488316ae6b4cc2422b1b.webm?t=1771561131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811390/extras/ae8b8fecd2eb488316ae6b4cc2422b1b.mp4?t=1771561131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developers had so much fun playing it during the testing process that they lost track of time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Laugh and have fun with your family and friends while playing [WASD: The Adventure of Tori]&quot;</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"STAGE 1 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811390/4ee19069cdfbaa41bec85391ae0eb3cf1c62267e.jpg"},{"name":"STAGE 2 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811390/dceb92960c1393d2ddf13a7a2de729169cc72a6c.jpg"},{"name":"STAGE 3 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811390/85971b033deaa591a702cd63294e919651cd623e.jpg"},{"name":"STAGE 4 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811390/62a76cbb296c192da6d66603f73d1a4b9304dcfe.jpg"},{"name":"STAGE 5 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamc